      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p class="Default">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; background: white;">Recorded pursuant to Section 36 of the General Terms and Conditions of our FERC Gas Tariff. Remaining balance at end of current filing period will be refunded through adjustments to future period fuel retention rates.</xhtml:span>
